{
  "name": "@ariskill/design-tokens",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "status": "provisional",
  "note": "PROVISIONAL tokens (OD-12: the AriSkill design system was not available). Every token carries `verified: null` until the brand owner maps it. No brand fonts or logos are used. Dark-first; the light theme is for flat admin surfaces; .theme-venue scales type for 1920x1080 displays viewed at 10-25 m. v1.1.0: dark palette shifted to the violet enchanted-cosmos mood chosen by the product owner on 2026-09-22 (game experience brief). v1.2.0: sticker language (art direction v2, D-25) adds the --sticker-* palette (navy sky, aurora teal->lime, lilac/violet-deep body, mint/cyan speckles, peach rim, gold star, rose belly, badge pill fill/ink, white die-cut outline + shadow) and --font-display (Fredoka, OFL, vendored under packages/vendor/fredoka) for badges, counters and hero words; body text stays Plus Jakarta Sans. The existing violet dark palette is unchanged and nothing was renamed.",
